  "body": "Hi,\r\n   I am trying to build a chat system where users can chat in a certain room without creating an account.\r\n   \r\n   What I want \r\n   User will give their Phone number and an OTP will be sent to their number they will insert it and then they will be able to start the chatting.\r\n   \r\n   I am trying to achieve it but so far I don't find any way to achieve this. Without registering a user I don't find a way to let the user get into the chat room.\r\n\r\n  Please give me feedback if it is possible.\r\n  \r\n  I set up the server using docker and Nginx proxy manager.\r\n  \r\n  Thanks,\r\n   ",
